+The paragraph and scene targets came from ASR pauses, so comparison with written paragraphing and explicit `---` breaks is directional. Here the written scene result is nonetheless close. Readability formulas are also blunt: they reward short, familiar words and cannot recognize conceptual sophistication. Even with those caveats, a 21.2-point FRE gap is too large to dismiss as proper-name noise.
